<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Verkehrsbank plans unchanged 96 dividend.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Verkehrsbank plans unchanged 96 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax oper profit		 14.7   vs 9.0</p>
<p>    Dividend				     4 marks vs 4 marks</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    7.2    vs n/a</p>
<p>    Group interest surplus		    64.8   vs 78.1</p>
<p>    Net income from financial business    10.1   vs 18.9</p>
<p>    Group operating expenses		  58.4   vs 91.3</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total		 9,100  vs 9,300</p>
<p>    Group business volume		     10,400 vs 10,800</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Deutsche Verkehr-Bank AG. Balance sheet total, business volume and credit volume compare with end-1995.</p>
</text>
